**Bug:** check-invocation-log-entry.sh code path (lines 211-213 region) dies exit 2 with 'requires --tooling-slice-id' when --allow-not-applicable is passed without --tooling-slice-id. But no test exercises this path.

**Fix:** in tests/check_invocation_log/test_check_invocation_log_entry.sh add test case:
- DISPATCH-NOTE has `cascade-status: not applicable` + `slice-type: tooling`
- Invoke with `--allow-not-applicable` and NO `--tooling-slice-id`
- Assert exit 2 with stderr containing 'requires --tooling-slice-id'

